{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 154, "line_no": 22, "text": "则诵经，指引亡灵登仙的路线，告诫亡灵路途中应注意的事项。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1436, "w": 1089, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "则诵经，指引亡灵登仙的路线，告诫亡灵路途中应注意的事项。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1436, "w": 1089, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
